    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-meinhardt-echinoderm-pentaradial-symmetry-parameter-expressivity> .

